Package: cbr
Title: Sparse Scanline Rasterization with 'controlledburn'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Sumner", , "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R bindings to the 'controlledburn' Rust crate for sparse scanline
    rasterization of polygons, lines, and points onto a regular grid, with exact
    coverage fractions for polygon boundary cells. Geometry input is accepted as
    well-known binary (WKB) via the 'wk' package.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc
Imports:
    graphics,
    grDevices,
    stats,
    wk
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.2)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
URL: https://github.com/mdsumner/cbr
BugReports: https://github.com/mdsumner/cbr/issues
